'''Madam Zelda''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found in Blackspore Swamp where she hosts special [[Quests|quests]] during the [[Super Spooktacular]]. She also assisted in the [[Trading Card Game|TCG Series 4]] ([[Baron von Darkcheat]]) by gathering all of the [[Realmkeepers]] together and training them to defeat the series namesake, [[Baron von Darkcheat (character)|Baron von Darkcheat]].

